.TH LL-BUILDER-EXPORT 1 "August 2026" "Linyaps 1.14.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ll-builder-export \- internal Linyaps builder export helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ll-builder-export
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ll-builder-export
is the export helper shipped with the Linyaps application builder.  It is
normally invoked by builder workflows rather than directly.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show command help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ll-builder (1)
